。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5e8fdfa9d4a246a90016576e4dc324e1ae8e583bb3e460e648ac3860d8889b0e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"cde1dce50f6a9dfcd5a2105533a016bca9b5384d5dd27fac2a4a1448fe4f5da8","logical_entry_identity":"4b7844d14e1b427d5ea067359da20014c13af9f11fda630a94f03e1eae2b9054","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your body is more like that of an ooze.\n\t\tWhen you take damage, you may split and create a Bloated Ooze nearby within your line of sight.\n\t\tThis ooze has as much health as twice the damage you took (up to a maximum of %d, based on your Mindpower and maximum life).\n\t\tThe chance to split equals the percent of your health lost times %0.2f.\n\t\tYou may have up to %d Bloated Oozes active at any time (limited by talent level and the summoning limit), and all damage you take will be split equally between you and them so long as this talent is active.\n\t\tBloated Oozes last for %d turns, are very resilient (%d%% all damage resistance to damage not coming through your shared link), and regenerate life quickly.\n\t\t%sThe chance to split increases with your Cunning.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的身体构造变得更像软泥怪。\n\t\t当你受到伤害时，你有几率分裂，并在附近视线内生成一个浮肿软泥怪。\n\t\t该软泥怪的生命值为你所受伤害的两倍（最大 %d，基于你的精神强度和最大生命值）。\n\t\t分裂几率等于你损失的生命值百分比乘以 %0.2f。\n\t\t你同时最多可以拥有 %d 只浮肿软泥怪（受技能等级与召唤上限限制）；只要本技能处于激活状态，你受到的所有伤害就会在你和它们之间平均分摊。\n\t\t每只浮肿软泥怪存在 %d 回合，极为坚韧（对并非通过共享连接传来的伤害拥有 %d%% 全伤害抗性），并能快速恢复生命。\n\t\t%s分裂几率随灵巧提升。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"59bdd7555568000c609d2ffd1e756319678f4ae10ff9a0162aa02e708f0471dc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f8996cc89df4227b9a855c3dbb27e654794b44674bf3e5a10509c544180bd9b5","logical_entry_identity":"55994f9100d57197818909b9ba6fc662fdae8dce398741a2f26b92d11bd3baa8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Through rigorous training, you have learned to focus your actions for a short while, increasing your speed by %d%% for 5 turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"通过严格的训练你已经学会在短时间内爆发你的速度，提高你 %d%% 速度 5